You may have problems when sharing your screen, the desktop becoming
unclickable (like, you can't click/select on icons, menus or windows).
This may be Wayland-related, making Zoom confused when in X11.

Try the following:

- Open ~/.config/zoomus.conf
- Change these as follows (to false):
	
	enableCefOsrMode=false
	xwayland=false
